# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
# build/web n'est plus versionné : la CI (job deploy-web) compile Flutter web
# et déploie sur Vercel à chaque push sur master. Build manuel de secours :
#   flutter build web --release --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=<url backend>/api
#   npx vercel deploy build/web --prod

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Vercel CLI
.vercel
